\par\par \uc2 Business/Financial Desk; SECTB\par \b \uc2 The Digest\b0\par\par\uc2 By Niraj Chokshi and Reuters \par \uc2 463 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 September 2025\par \uc2 The New York Times\par \uc2 NYTF\par \uc2 Late Edition - Final\par 2\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2025 The New York Times Company.  All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 LABOR\par \par \uc2 Boeing\uc2  to Replace Strikers With Permanent Workers\par \par \uc2 Boeing\uc2  said on Thursday that it planned to start hiring permanent replacements for workers who went on strike a month ago from three factories in and around St. Louis that make equipment for the military.\par \par \uc2 About 3,200 workers who build fighter jets and advanced aircraft and weapons systems walked off the job on Aug. 4 after the company and their union, the \uc2 International Association of Machinists and Aerospace Workers\uc2  District 837, failed to ratify a new contract.\par \par \uc2 In a statement, a \uc2 Boeing\uc2  executive said the company was moving to hire workers because the two sides had made little progress since the strike began.\par \par \uc2 ''Unfortunately, the union continues to demand more of everything while also saying it has no control over what it will take to end the strike, driving the parties further apart,'' Dan Gillian, a \uc2 Boeing\uc2  vice president and top St. Louis executive, said in a statement. NIRAJ CHOKSHI\par \par \uc2 AUTOMOTIVE\par \par \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  and \uc2 BMW\uc2  Offer Automated Driving\par \par \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  and \uc2 BMW\uc2  announced an automated driving system on Friday, which could help attract customers with new features like hands-free driving assistance.\par \par \uc2 The Snapdragon Ride Pilot driver-assistance system will debut in \uc2 BMW\uc2 's electric iX3 and offers hands-free highway driving, automatic lane changes and parking assistance, the companies said. \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  said the technology has been validated for use in more than 60 countries, with plans to expand coverage to over 100 in 2026.\par \par \uc2 The driver remains responsible for supervising the vehicle, and the system does not constitute fully autonomous ''Level 5'' driving.\par \par \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2 , which is a leading supplier of the chips used in smartphones, has been pushing deeper into automotive electronics, from infotainment to advanced driver-assistance systems. REUTERS\par \par \uc2 ENERGY\par \par \uc2 Orsted Funds Approved To Deal With U.S. Policy\par \par \uc2 Orsted\uc2  won shareholder approval on Friday for a $9.4 billion emergency rights issue to help fund U.S. offshore wind projects thrown into uncertainty by President Trump's opposition to the renewable energy source.\par \par \uc2 At the heart of the drama are Orsted's Sunrise Wind and Revolution Wind projects. Two-thirds of the new capital is earmarked for Sunrise Wind, a project that potential co-investors fled after the White House ordered Norway's \uc2 Equinor\uc2  to halt a neighboring wind farm in April.\par \par \uc2 Last month, U.S. officials also issued a stop-work order for the nearly finished Revolution Wind site. \uc2 Orsted\uc2 's chief executive, \uc2 Rasmus Errboe\uc2 , told Reuters that the company is incurring weekly costs of $15.7 million for its 50 percent stake in Revolution Wind, co-owned with Skyborn Renewables.\par \par \uc2 ''It's going to be a long, tough journey to re-erect Orsted,'' company chair Lene Skole told shareholders. REUTERS\par \par \uc2 Document NYTF000020250906el960004r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw284\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal4260\pichgoal600
